data: {"id": "ff496df8dc894018-thinking-parallel_evidence-1276", "run_id": "ff496df8dc894018", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实与因果分析：\n\n**实体身份确认**\n- Pod: `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl` (UID: `5c278abe-982e-4ea1-9540-d55e1de90b26`)\n- 当前状态: Running 但 `Ready=False`，Reason=`ContainersNotReady`。\n- 容器状态: `app` 容器处于 `CrashLoopBackOff`，重启次数 `11` 次，最后退出码 `exitCode=78`。\n\n**支持“配置缺失导致崩溃”的证据**\n1. **日志直接报错**: 无论是当前日志还是崩溃前日志 (Previous Logs)，均反复出现 `{\"event\":\"http_request\",\"level\":\"error\",\"message\":\"CONFIG_MISSING\",...}`。这表明应用在处理请求时检测到关键配置缺失。\n2. **退出码特征**: 退出码 `78` (EX_UNAVAILABLE) 通常由应用主动调用 `sys.exit(78)` 触发。结合 ConfigMap ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 6, "ts_ms": 1789074232995, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

